--- an empty tensor under gpu[] stays on the CPU: shown, joined and added
--- to itself it is the empty tensor in both modes (it had been put on the
--- GPU, and reading it back mapped an empty buffer slice, which wgpu
--- refuses: "buffer slices can not be empty" — every model of pie's under
--- gpu[] stopped at its first empty tensor)
use math
gpu[]
x = zeros[0]
log[x]
log[len[x]]
log[concat[x, ones[3]]]
log[x + x]
y = tensor[[1.0, 2.0, 3.0]]
log[slice[y, 1, 1] + slice[y, 2, 2]]
log[y + y]
